{"id":"sinceridad","lemma":"sinceridad","pos":"noun","rank":4452,"glosses":["sincerity","honesty"],"ipa":"/sinθeɾiˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"sinceridades"},"order":4453,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-sinceridad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tienes que responder con sinceridad.","en":"You must answer honestly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/551533","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to answer, to reply"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"La sinceridad es una virtud.","en":"Honesty is a virtue.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449205","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"virtue"}]},{"text":"Deberíamos tratar a los otros con sinceridad.","en":"We should treat others with sincerity.","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to treat"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"},{"g":"with"},null]}]}